OL,5,G2200 Fergie: Where Did All the Money...
OL,6,     F...Go? This revealing documentary
OL,7,     Ftakes us onboard Sarah Ferguson's
OL,8,     Ffinancial rollercoaster. How did a
OL,9,     FDuchess find herself repeatedly in
OL,10,     Ffinancial turmoil - and how does
OL,11,     Fshe bounce back?
OL,12,G2300 Taggart
OL,13,     FAt the annual Strathclyde CID
OL,14,     Fdinner, the hotel owner is found
OL,15,     Fstrangled. When the main suspect
OL,16,     Fis also murdered, Jardine and Reid
OL,17,     Fface a complex case that will test
OL,18,     Fthem to the limit.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
