OL,5,G0105 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FFred returns home without the
OL,7,     Fmoney, and earns himself a
OL,8,     Fbeating. After shoplifting and
OL,9,     Fattacking a woman with an
OL,10,     Fumbrella, Edie is sent to
OL,11,     FWentworth, and Dr Clements upsets
OL,12,     FDoreen.
OL,13,G0210 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,14,     FLizzie befriends Edie, Monica and
OL,15,     FJoyce try to beat Blossom up when
OL,16,     Fthey realise who she is, and the
OL,17,     Fkey to Joyce's safety deposit box
OL,18,     Fgoes missing.
